# ruff: noqa: E501
"""The flows in the systemap map.

`map/model.py` imports FLOWS from this file. A flow gives its source, target,
artifact and kind. control: a component starts another component. data: an
artifact moves. judge: the procedure that writes and examines the model.

A reviewed flow also gives its source records and its review digest. Each source
record is a module and the digest of its source. A change opens the flow review
again. All values are literal values, so systemap reads this file without running it."""

